// "there are seven or more cards in your graveyard" — the Threshold-style
// graveyard census. A `Condition`-kind macro so it stands as the
// `condition:` of an `ActivatedAbility`'s "Activate only if …" rider and any
// other condition-reading frame. Reuses the exact `And([InZone(Graveyard),
// Owner(Ref(You))])` graveyard-census idiom other productions already use
// (Delve, ShuffleYourGraveyardIntoLibrary).
(
    name: "SevenOrMoreCardsInYourGraveyard",
    template: "there are seven or more cards in your graveyard",
    kinds: [Condition],
    body: Compare(CountOf(Objects(And([InZone(Graveyard), Owner(Ref(You))]))), AtLeast, 7),
)
